msgid "Commit information returned by `commit_info()` and `log()` contains `oid`, `message`, `summary`, `author`, `committer`, and `parent_oids`. A signature table contains `name`, `email`, `time_seconds`, and `offset_minutes`."
msgstr "La información de commit devuelta por `commit_info()` y `log()` contiene `oid`, `message`, `summary`, `author`, `committer` y `parent_oids`. Una tabla de firma contiene `name`, `email`, `time_seconds` y `offset_minutes`."

